<h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
<p>Zebra Medical Vision, now part of Nanox AI, is a pioneering platform in automated radiology analysis, deploying over 12 AI algorithms across more than 1,000 hospitals worldwide. Founded in 2014, Zebra was among the first companies to develop comprehensive AI solutions for detecting multiple conditions from medical imaging studies. The platform analyzes CT scans, MRIs, and X-rays to identify a wide range of abnormalities including cardiovascular disease, liver conditions, bone health issues, and lung pathologies.</p>
<p>What distinguishes Zebra Medical Vision is its "All-in-One" approach, where a single integration provides hospitals access to multiple AI algorithms that work across different imaging modalities and clinical conditions. Rather than deploying separate AI tools for each condition, Zebra's unified platform automatically analyzes studies for dozens of findings simultaneously. This comprehensive screening approach helps radiologists catch incidental findings that might otherwise be overlooked and prioritizes urgent cases requiring immediate attention.</p>
<p>Zebra's algorithms are trained on millions of annotated imaging studies and have received CE marking in Europe and regulatory clearances in multiple countries. The platform integrates seamlessly with hospital PACS systems, providing automated analysis without disrupting radiologist workflows. With proven clinical validation and deployment at scale, Zebra Medical Vision represents enterprise-grade AI for modern radiology departments seeking to improve diagnostic accuracy and operational efficiency.</p>
<h2 id="features">Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="10" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="11"></rect><circle cx="8" cy="15" r="1"></circle><circle cx="16" cy="15" r="1"></circle><path d="M9 7L9 9M15 7L15 9M12 2v5"></path></svg></div><h4>Automated Radiology Analysis</h4><p>Comprehensive AI analysis of CT, MRI, and X-ray studies for multiple conditions simultaneously. Automatically screens every study without radiologist intervention.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"></path></svg></div><h4>Multi-Condition Anomaly Detection</h4><p>Detects cardiovascular disease, fatty liver, osteoporosis, lung nodules, compression fractures, and more. Single platform for diverse pathology identification.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div><h4>Automated Prioritization</h4><p>Flags critical and urgent findings for immediate radiologist review. Ensures time-sensitive cases are addressed first to improve patient outcomes.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2L2 7v10c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V7l-10-5z"></path><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="16"></line><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="12" y2="12"></line></svg></div><h4>Multiple Condition Coverage</h4><p>12+ validated algorithms covering cardiovascular, pulmonary, musculoskeletal, and abdominal conditions. Expanding algorithm library through ongoing research.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="18" x2="18" y1="20" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="20" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" x2="6" y1="20" y2="14"></line></svg></div><h4>CT/MRI/X-ray Support</h4><p>Works across major imaging modalities without separate integrations. Comprehensive coverage for radiology department needs.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/></svg></div><h4>PACS Integration</h4><p>Seamless integration with existing Picture Archiving and Communication Systems. Results delivered directly to radiologist workstations.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg></div><h4>Regulatory Approved</h4><p>CE marked in Europe with clearances in multiple countries. Meets rigorous safety and efficacy standards for clinical deployment.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="M12 1v6m0 6v6m5.66-16.35l-3.87 3.88m-3.78 3.79l-3.87 3.88m13.52 0l-3.87-3.88m-3.78-3.79l-3.87-3.88"></path></svg></div><h4>Clinical Workflow Enhancement</h4><p>Designed to augment radiologist productivity without disrupting established workflows. Provides actionable insights at point of interpretation.</p></div>
</div>
<h2 id="pros-cons">Pros &amp; Cons</h2>
<div class="pros-cons-grid">
<div class="pros-box"><h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Advantages</h4><ul><li>Comprehensive multi-condition analysis</li><li>Single integration for multiple algorithms</li><li>Detects incidental findings automatically</li><li>Strong clinical validation</li><li>Deployed at scale (1000+ hospitals)</li><li>Works across imaging modalities</li><li>Seamless PACS integration</li><li>Regulatory approvals in multiple regions</li><li>Prioritizes urgent cases</li><li>Reduces radiologist workload</li></ul></div>
<div class="cons-box"><h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"/><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"/></svg> Disadvantages</h4><ul><li>Enterprise pricing only</li><li>Requires PACS infrastructure</li><li>Limited to supported conditions</li><li>May generate false positives</li><li>Algorithm performance varies by condition</li><li>Implementation complexity</li><li>Training required for optimal use</li><li>Dependent on image quality</li></ul></div>
</div>
<h2 id="pricing">Pricing Plans</h2>
